  "content": "<p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/438855099efde06f60324937fe32dd437753164b.png\" alt=\"baldes\">\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2P8kfceSmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1446530427337576541?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=728ADA\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/refined-buckets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1419333?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=curseforge&color=F16436\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frefined-buckets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/l2nl8HQJ?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=1CD96A\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/899c0e364c509449cd21d46c78cd5a7775ff9951.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n</p>\n<p>此資源包對水桶進行了改造，賦予其更精緻的 3D 外觀。預設情況下，GUI 模型將保持 2D，因此與其他更改圖案的資源包兼容。同時還包含美西螈變體！若使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>HMI</strong></a>，還可顯示魚類動畫。</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/apuaudc.gif\">\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6570fc1c8af37836ab6d9863e9b10a47862ff43.png\" alt=\"Important\">\n</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">推薦模組</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border:none;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;border:none\">\n        <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c8108654883aaca19ccdadf2a83eba944e75e9c7_0.webp\" style=\"width:220px\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">1.21.5 及以下版本所需模組</h3>\n<table style=\"width:66%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border:none\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;border:none\">\n        <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1c7d49076aee0da5de6f0f696d2653ebdcb00746.png\" style=\"width:100%\"></a>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;border:none\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3def4b5c56adced6eb1c1a771b2fcc8d84930ef2_0.webp\" style=\"width:100%\"></a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
